Machine Learning models on

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:46.510
that data stored in BigQuery,
just with a single SQL query.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:49.300
So you don't have to move your
data out of BigQuery to use it.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:50.530
It's super simple to use.

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:51.613
So you just write a query.

00:02:51.613 --> 00:02:53.905
Your models train, and then
you can write another query

00:02:53.905 --> 00:02:54.960
